Round 6, security+quality: no Critical, one Important. `tests/orca-cli-skills.sh`'s `nodisplay` probes still keep your real runtime dir, D-Bus and profile. If node mode broke, they could reach your live Orca. That was already on master, but it's the same safety class as my test's `appnode`, so I'll fix it the same way.

I'll take the cheap nits too:
